{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.AddableBoxHookOneRow","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.AddableBoxHookOneRow","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.AddableBoxHookOneRow.oneRow_addable_hook_recurrence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.AddableBoxHookOneRow.oneRow_addable_hook_recurrence","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/AddableBoxHookOneRow.lean#L55-L62","doc":"**The one-row addable-box hook recurrence** `[n+1]_q = q·[n]_q + q^{−n}`, the content of the\nidentity (B) at `μ = (n)`. Direct proof from the balanced formula; equivalently\n`qBracket_add q hq n 1` with `[1]_q = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}